OL,3,GNEWSAA11 closed after truck overturns
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe A11 has been closed in both
OL,6,Fdirections after a heavy goods lorry
OL,7,Foverturned.
OL,9,FNational Highways said the road has
OL,10,Fbeen shut between the A1065 Fiveways
OL,11,FRoundabout at Mildenhall, Suffolk, and
OL,12,Fthe A134 at Elveden.
OL,14,FSuffolk Police have been turning
OL,15,Ftraffic caught between the closure and
OL,16,Fsaid repairs were required to the
OL,17,Fcarriageway barrier.
OL,19,FDrivers have been warned to expect
OL,20,Fdelays and congestion and that
OL,21,Fdiversions were in place.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
